* ============================================================
* Ring-oscillator VCO, current-starved, sky130
* Block: VCO (Review 1 deliverable)
*
* Topology: 5-stage current-starved inverter ring.
* Bias generator: Vctrl -> Mnb (V-to-I) -> diode-connected Mpb
*   mirrors Ibias into every stage's PMOS current source (vbiasp).
*   Vctrl itself drives every stage's NMOS current source gate
*   directly (vbiasn = vctrl), matched sizing to Mnb.
*
* Ports: vctrl vdd vss vout
* Params:
*   wn_inv/ln_inv, wp_inv/lp_inv   - switching devices per stage
*   wcs/lcs                        - current-source devices (both rails + bias gen)
* ============================================================

.subckt VCO_STAGE in out vbiasp vbiasn vdd vss
+ wn_inv=1.0 ln_inv=0.5 wp_inv=2.0 lp_inv=0.5 wcs=2.0 lcs=0.5

Xmp_cs  nodeA  vbiasp vdd    vdd  sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l={lcs}    w={wcs}
Xmp_inv out    in     nodeA  vdd  sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l={lp_inv} w={wp_inv}
Xmn_inv out    in     nodeB  vss  sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l={ln_inv} w={wn_inv}
Xmn_cs  nodeB  vbiasn vss    vss  sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l={lcs}    w={wcs}

.ends VCO_STAGE


.subckt VCO_RING vctrl vdd vss vout
+ nstages=5 wn_inv=1.0 ln_inv=0.5 wp_inv=2.0 lp_inv=0.5 wcs=2.0 lcs=0.5

* --- bias generator: Vctrl sets Ibias via Mnb, mirrored to Mpb -> vbiasp ---
Xmnb vbiasp vctrl vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l={lcs} w={wcs}
Xmpb vbiasp vbiasp vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l={lcs} w={wcs}

* --- 5-stage ring (odd count enforced by instantiation below) ---
Xs1 n5 n1 vbiasp vctrl vdd vss VCO_STAGE wn_inv={wn_inv} ln_inv={ln_inv} wp_inv={wp_inv} lp_inv={lp_inv} wcs={wcs} lcs={lcs}
Xs2 n1 n2 vbiasp vctrl vdd vss VCO_STAGE wn_inv={wn_inv} ln_inv={ln_inv} wp_inv={wp_inv} lp_inv={lp_inv} wcs={wcs} lcs={lcs}
Xs3 n2 n3 vbiasp vctrl vdd vss VCO_STAGE wn_inv={wn_inv} ln_inv={ln_inv} wp_inv={wp_inv} lp_inv={lp_inv} wcs={wcs} lcs={lcs}
Xs4 n3 n4 vbiasp vctrl vdd vss VCO_STAGE wn_inv={wn_inv} ln_inv={ln_inv} wp_inv={wp_inv} lp_inv={lp_inv} wcs={wcs} lcs={lcs}
Xs5 n4 n5 vbiasp vctrl vdd vss VCO_STAGE wn_inv={wn_inv} ln_inv={ln_inv} wp_inv={wp_inv} lp_inv={lp_inv} wcs={wcs} lcs={lcs}

* startup helper: tiny cap to break the degenerate all-equal DC solution
Cstart n1 vss 1f

Eout vout vss n5 vss 1
.ends VCO_RING
